      "body": "Run:\n\n```bash\nnvidia-smi\n```\n\nOr for just the index/name/memory in a compact table:\n\n```bash\nnvidia-smi --query-gpu=index,name,memory.total,memory.used --format=csv\n```\n\nOn this machine that showed a single GPU at index `0` (Tesla T4), which is why `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES = \"0\"` in the notebook is correct here \u2014 there's only one to pick."
